OL,3,GNEWSATown centre Post Office reopens in
OL,4,Anew location
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town centre Post Office has reopened
OL,7,Fin a new location after the shop it
OL,8,Fpreviously operated from announced it
OL,9,Fwas closing.
OL,11,FThe branch was forced to shut when
OL,12,FTGJones on Westgate Street in Ipswich
OL,13,Fclosed down in June.
OL,15,FThe new Post Office has opened inside
OL,16,Fthe Sailmakers Shopping Centre on
OL,17,FTavern Street, as part of a new store
OL,18,Fcalled Smiles for Miles, which is open
OL,19,FMonday to Saturday between 09:00 and
OL,20,F17:30 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
