OL,3,GNEWSATown centre Post Office reopens in
OL,4,Anew location
OL,5,
OL,6,FPost Office retail change leader Wendy
OL,7,FHamilton said: "We know how important a
OL,8,FPost Office is to the residents,
OL,9,Fbusinesses and visitors to Ipswich and
OL,10,Fwe are delighted to be restoring
OL,11,Fservice to the city centre and in time
OL,12,Ffor the busy Christmas period."
